strategy and technology group solutions; insurance-linked securities, capital raising, strategic advice, restructuring, and merger and acquisition services; and risk management products and solutions, capital market solutions, and corporate finance advisory services. In addition, the company offers strategic design advice and actuarial services; pension risk transfer and integrated pension administration; and investment advisory services on developing and maintaining investment programs across various plan types, including defined benefit plans, defined contribution plans, master trusts, and pooled employer plans for corporations, public pensions, endowments, and foundations. Aon plc was incorporated in 1979 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Gregory Clarence Case | President, CEO & Executive Director | Age 62 | Compensation: $5.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 60K people. Revenue per employee of $286K ranks in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers, improving at 5%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $54K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $7K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 17\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["Aon plc is a large-cap financial services business with a $71.0B market cap on $17.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +11% over the past three years and +4% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size.","Returns on capital run at 19% against a 7% cost of capital \u2014 a 12-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $3.2B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 19 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, with adequate 0.94\u00d7 cash conversion.","On the balance sheet, debt is moderate at 2.7\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, serviceable in normal conditions but worth watching through a downturn, and interest coverage runs at 5.3\u00d7.","Shareholder yield is only 0.8%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.7) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Carries a 39% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.38614520886858883},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 12% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Large open-market insider purchases (net $3.5M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","38 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Aon and funds managed by Blackstone launch Cortina, a new Lloyd's syndicate offering efficient, long-term capital to reinsurance clients","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/aon-funds-managed-blackstone-launch-153500632.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793979300.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.912,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"Aon and Blackstone Unveil Cortina Syndicate 1956 at Lloyd's with QBE as Managing Agent","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/aon-and-blackstone-unveil-cortina-syndicate-1956-at-lloyds-with-qbe-as-managing-agent","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793978179.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["product"]},{"title":"What Does Aon (AON) Expanding Client Treaty Capacity To 35% Mean?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/does-aon-aon-expanding-client-211430261.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793913270.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.796,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Aon (AON) Lifts Aon Client Treaty Co Insurance To 35% For 2027","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/insurance/nyse-aon/aon/news/aon-aon-lifts-aon-client-treaty-co-insurance-to-35-for-2027","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793910178.266,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.735,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"AON (NYSE:AON) Stock Gets Price Target Cut from UBS Group","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/aon-nyseaon-stock-gets-price-target-cut-from-ubs-group.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793861694.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.44,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"HSA-eligible health plans in 2027: What to know about tax savings vs. higher deductibles","sour